# Red Light, Green Light
<img src="https://github.com/cyberm3n-org/SC_2026/blob/main/ref_images/StopGo_Front.png">

### Build List Items
| Ref | Value | Marking Color |
| D1, D3 | Red LED | |
| D2, D4 | Green LED |  |
| R1, R3 | 100 | Purple |
| R2, R4 | 20 | Brown |

### Steps
1. Solder Resistors on the back
2. Solder LEDs
3. Trim LEDs legs
4. After Soldering the Header PINs, place PCB into printed cube
